  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Masters Degree Program in Control of Infectious Disease(2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this educational program is to systematically train essential healthcare professionals in the field of infectious disease response through comprehensive education on overall policies, systems, capacities, education, mangement, and surveillance related to infectious disease preparedness</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program aims to strengthen control of infectious disease for public sector employees who are interested in infectious disease&#xAC10;&#xC5FC;&#xBCD1; &#xB300;&#xC751; &#xBD84;&#xC57C; &#xC11D;&#xC0AC; &#xD559;&#xC704;&#xC5F0;&#xC218; &#xACFC;&#xC815; &#xCC38;&#xC5EC; &#xC5F0;&#xC218;&#xC0DD;&#xC758; &#xAC10;&#xC5FC;&#xBCD1; &#xB300;&#xC751; &#xAD00;&#xB828; &#xC815;&#xCC45; &#xBC0F; &#xC81C;&#xB3C4; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9; &#xAC15;&#xD654;&#xC640; &#xD559;&#xC704; &#xCDE8;&#xB4DD; &#xC2E4;&#xC801;&#xC744; &#xBE44;&#xB86F;&#xD558;&#xC5EC; &#xC5F0;&#xC218; &#xC774;&#xD6C4; &#xC5F0;&#xAD6C; &#xB17C;&#xBB38;&#xC5D0; &#xB300;&#xD55C; &#xD655;&#xC0B0;&#xC744; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xC9C0;&#xC2DD;&#xD655;&#xC0B0; &#xD6A8;&#xACFC; &#xB4F1; &#xAE30;&#xB300;</narrative>
